GRADER_SUBJECT=a manufacturing assistant (cableAI chat) that can see the plant's live MES data only through read-only tools: production jobs with their lots, production orders, and lot inventory. It also has DesignCenter (cableCORE) tools, but those hold cable designs, not shop-floor process data. It has no machine recipes, temperatures, historical line speeds, die or tooling data, sensor feeds or prediction models. Any claim about MES facts that no successful MES tool call supports is a fail. Saying clearly that the data or capability does not exist, and offering what it can show from the MES, is 'not supported', not a fail.
